[27.180098, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0m# \u001b[0mTodos\r\n[•] Generate KD02 n+90Zr @50 MeV potential (omp.py)\r\n[ ] Build FRESCO elastic deck from B1-elastic.in\r\n[ ] Run FRESCO, verify convergence (anchor sigma_R=1301.64017 mb)\r\n[ ] Find EXFOR data for n+90Zr elastic (list entries)\r\n[ ] Extract angular distribution, compare with data\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[28.792306, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mpython3 /Users/jinlei/.config/opencode/skills/fresco/scripts/omp.py --code kd02 --proj n --target 90Zr --energy 50\r\n! KD02 global OMP, n + 90Zr, E_lab = 50.0 MeV\r\n! target Z=40 A=90;  ap=0 forces R = r0*At^(1/3), the convention both KD02 and this script use.\r\n! neutron projectile: rc is unused but the type=0 line must still be present.\r\n &POT kp=1 type=0 ap=0.000 at=90.000 rc=1.200000 /\r\n &POT kp=1 type=1 p1=35.274524 p2=1.213437 p3=0.664417 p4=4.760451 p5=1.213437 p6=0.664417 /\r\n &POT kp=1 type=2 p4=3.793594 p5=1.271370 p6=0.529696 /\r\n &POT kp=1 type=3 p1=4.892278 p2=1.041026 p3=0.590000 p4=-0.369964 p5=1.041026 p6=0.590000 /\r\n &pot /\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
