[29.965236, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mpython3 /Users/jinlei/.config/opencode/skills/exfor-data/scripts/exfor.py list 22480\r\nTITLE: Experiments on neutron scattering and fission neutron spectra\r\n\r\nSUBENT           N  ENERGY (as given)            REACTION\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n22480001         0  -                            -\r\n22480002        75  55., 65., 75.                (6-C-0(N,EL)6-C-0,,DA)\r\n22480003        75  55., 65., 75.                (14-SI-0(N,EL)14-SI-0,,DA)\r\n22480004        75  55., 65., 75.                (26-FE-0(N,EL)26-FE-0,,DA)\r\n22480005        75  55., 65., 75.                (40-ZR-0(N,EL)40-ZR-0,,DA)\r\n22480006        75  55., 65., 75.                (82-PB-0(N,EL)82-PB-0,,DA)\r\n22480007        20  75.                          (6-C-12(N,EL)6-C-12,,DA)\r\n\r\nUnits for the energy column are in the subentry itself; run `data <SUBENT>` to see them.\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
